## 4. URL Parameters & Headless Tools

The engine exposes URL query parameters for debugging, deterministic replay, and headless balance analysis:

| Parameter | Function |
|---|---|
| `?p1=...&p2=...` | Pre-populates prompt inputs for Player 1 and Player 2. |
| `&auto=1` | Skips prompt entry directly into analysis and battle. |
| `?seed=N` | Replays an exact fight using a 32-bit deterministic Mulberry32 seed. |
| `?bench=200` | Headlessly runs $N$ battles across all archetype matchups and outputs a balance table to `console.table`. |
| `?penbench=200` | Headlessly runs $N$ rounds of Pen Fight 3D across matchups. |
| `?human=1` | Enables direct keyboard control for Player 1 (`A`/`D` to move, `W` to jump, `Space` to attack). |
| `?hitboxes=1` | Renders green hurtboxes and red attack collision boxes. |
| `?flat=1` | Disables pseudo-3D perspective camera, reverting to classic flat 2D canvas view. |
| `?mode=pen` | Boots directly into Pen Fight mode. |

