## 5. Execution Instructions

The project requires no build tools, compilers, or external package managers.

To launch locally:
```bash
# Start a local HTTP server in the repository root
python -m http.server 8080

# Navigate in any modern WebGL-compatible browser
http://localhost:8080
```
*(Running through an HTTP server rather than opening `index.html` as a `file://` URI is necessary to prevent browser security restrictions with WebGL shaders and Web3 wallet extensions).*
